WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
So many benefits out of thin air

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,440
Are you sure he doesn't know it was you?

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,920
Of course he doesn't know

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,440
He is different from those women who hide their money.

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:08,960
He is independent and proud

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,200
pure and beautiful

7
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:21,710
I must catch him. I have a way for you to catch him. Are you sure about what you can do?

8
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:25,110
As long as I insist on ignoring him, not sending him messages, and not spending money on him

9
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:26,350
He will take the initiative to come to me

10
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:27,990
Doesn’t he have a poor best friend?

11
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,670
Just make an appointment with his best friend on Guangguang Street as usual, and then give him a random date as a best friend

12
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:33,070
I can guarantee that the gift of tens of thousands of survival coins will not last for a month.

13
00:00:33,270 --> 00:00:35,310
He will take the initiative to come to you. Why are you so sure?

14
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:39,510
What if he doesn't care at all? If I lose, you give me a one-star rating. If I win,

15
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,870
You can give me 10,000 survival coins

16
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:43,750
There are many survival coins.
